# What `vercel deploy` must never upload from this folder (D1). Secrets stay on the machine;
# Vercel gets its values from the project's environment variables. Paths with a leading slash
# are the root only ("data" alone would also match src/core/data).
.env*
!.env.example
/.vercel
/.next
/node_modules
/logs
/test-results
/playwright-report
/supabase/.temp
/data
